屋齡", "value": "-", "key": "age", "cate": 1, "help": "", "alias": ""}]}, "service": {"title": "提供設備", "active": 1, "facility": [{"key": "fridge", "active": 1, "name": "冰箱"}, {"key": "washer", "active": 1, "name": "洗衣機"}, {"key": "tv", "active": 1, "name": "電視"}, {"key": "cold", "active": 1, "name": "冷氣"}, {"key": "heater", "active": 1, "name": "熱水器"}, {"key": "bed", "active": 1, "name": "床"}, {"key": "closet", "active": 1, "name": "衣櫃"}, {"key": "fourth", "active": 1, "name": "第四台"}, {"key": "net", "active": 1, "name": "網路"}, {"key": "gas", "active": 0, "name": "天然瓦斯"}, {"key": "sofa", "active": 0, "name": "沙發"}, {"key": "table_chairs", "active": 1, "name": "桌椅"}, {"key": "balcony", "active": 0, "name": "陽台"}, {"key": "lift", "active": 0, "name": "電梯"}, {"key": "park", "active": 0, "name": "車位"}], "notice": [{"key": "leaseTime", "name": "最短一年"}, {"key": "degree", "name": "學生"}, {"key": "pet", "name": "不可養寵物"}, {"key": "cook", "name": "不可開伙"}]}, "preference": {"title": "優選理由", "active": 1, "footnote": "還有1個選擇本房的理由", "data": [{"id": 1, "name": "產權有保障", "text": "已在地政局辦理建物產權登記，選擇更安心", "icon": "https://s.591.com.tw/build/static/app/rent/perfer_01.png"}, {"id": 2, "name": "屋主直租", "text": "屋主本人發佈，減少中間人干預，無需服務費", "icon": "https://s.591.com.tw/build/static/app/rent/perfer_02.png"}, {"id": 3, "name": "拎包入住", "text": "滿足90%的日常所需設備，享輕鬆入住體驗", "icon": "https://s.591.com.tw/build/static/app/rent/perfer_03.png"}, {"id": 4, "name": "7日上新", "text": "2天前發佈，租到概率高", "icon": "https://s.591.com.tw/build/static/app/rent/perfer_04.png"}]}, "remark": {"title": "屋主說", "key": "remark", "active": 1, "content": "<p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">一、地理位置</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><u>正延平北路五段</u></strong>上，不是在巷弄裡面，下樓就是<strong><u>7-11和全家</u></strong>，步行三分鐘內就有<strong><u>全聯、屈臣氏、銀行、藥局、診所、生活百貨及各類小吃店</u></strong>。<strong><u>社子市場、葫蘆堵市場</u></strong>都是步行可達，極為方便。</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;鄰近<strong><u>國道一號、百齡橋和重陽橋</u></strong>。無論是要去外縣市還是要往士林、三重蘆洲地區都很方便。附近有地下停車場可以月租，路邊的機車格也很多。</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">二、格局及屋況</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><u>公寓三樓</u></strong>，空間寬敞，窗簾若拉開採光非常好。</span></p><p data-indent=\"3\" dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">隔壁間有其他租客，公用走廊上無堆置任何雜物。</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">三、室內設備</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;除了最基本的電視、冰箱以外，另提供租客最新的<strong><u>Google&nbsp;TV機上盒</u></strong>，基本上就是一台智慧電視，可以非常流暢的使用<strong><u>Youtube、Netflix</u></strong>等功能（帳號需自備）。</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;有獨立的洗衣機可以使用，衛浴也是<strong><u>乾濕分離</u></strong>的。</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><u>租金已包含網路費和第四台</u></strong>在內，也有<strong><u>獨立分電錶</u></strong>。</span></p><p data-indent=\"3\" dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">基本上有硬體設備上的問題，我都會積極處理。</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">四、聯絡方式及注意事項</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;有問題的話請先掃描行動條碼(QR&nbsp;Code)，以<strong><u>LINE聯絡</u></strong>為先。平常比較忙，如果訊息有比較晚回覆請見諒。撥電話的話我很有可能會沒接到；因為591不會顯示來電，所以我也<strong><u>沒辦法回撥給您</u></strong>。</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;只提供租客本人<strong><u>一位入住</u></strong>，<strong><u>請不要攜帶任何人回來過夜</u></strong>。隔壁的租客都租了很久，所以請放低音量不要打擾到其他人。</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><u>屋主自租，仲介勿擾</u></strong>。我知道各位仲介、包租代管業者你們很辛苦，但請不要再白費力氣聯絡我了。</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">五、其他</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;可以報<strong><u>租金補貼</u></strong>，可以<strong><u>報稅</u></strong>。</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><u>禁菸、禁寵物、禁酗酒、禁打牌。</u></strong></span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;原先是自己的朋友承租，因搬回老家才釋出，我只想出租給生活單純的<strong><u>學生</u></strong>，希望能夠找到相互尊重及配合的租客。平時我不太會干涉租客的生活，只希望您能愛惜房子，遵守規定。</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;看過資訊及照片假如有興趣者可以<strong><u>LINE聯絡</u></strong>，有其他問題也可以<strong><u>看完屋後雙方再討論。</u></strong></span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><u>不接受視訊看屋，</u></strong>詐騙甚麼的就別來了。</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;最後，<strong><u>聯絡請保持基本的禮貌</u></strong>，謝謝。</span></p>\r\n附近有便利商店、傳統市場、公園綠地、學校、醫療機構。"}, "surround": {"title": "周邊配套", "key": "surround", "active": 1, "address": "士林區延平北路五段", "lat": "25.083992", "lng": "121.5101067", "data": [{"name": "交通", "key": "traffic", "children": [{"type": "bus", "name": "葫蘆堵市場站", "distance": 106, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約106公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "葫東重慶路口站", "distance": 140, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約140公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "葫蘆寺(葫蘆里)站", "distance": 152, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約152公尺"}]}, {"name": "生活", "key": "live", "children": [{"type": "shop", "name": "貝谷樂企業行", "distance": 1428, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約1428公尺"}, {"type": "restaurant", "name": "極禾 鍋物職人-北市延平店", "distance": 4, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約4公尺"}]}, {"name": "教育", "key": "education", "children": [{"type": "primary", "name": "臺北市士林區葫蘆國民小學", "distance": 267, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約267公尺"}, {"type": "university", "name": "銘傳大學", "distance": 923, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約923公尺"}]}]}, "cost": {"title": "費用詳情", "active": 1, "dat